<title>UK: Citibank sets call warrants on Valora.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call warrants on Valora.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued four million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Valora, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland) said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    350 CHF		   PREMIUM	18.25 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.55 CHF		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14 AUG.98		 PAYDATE	13.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  326 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
